  "automation_frameworks": {
    "instruction": "Bound automatically from the detected stack target. If the repo already has an automation framework installed, that one WINS over the default - never introduce a second framework alongside an existing one. If the repo has none and two are equally viable for the target, ask the user to choose between exactly those two.",
