    "note": "Packs live in packs/languages/<id>.md and packs/concerns/<id>.md. A role agent loads the packs it is given, in order, and applies them on top of its own role contract. A diff spanning two languages loads both language packs into one reviewer rather than running two agents.",
    "role_agents": {
      "review": "code-reviewer",
      "security": "security-reviewer",
      "build_repair": "build-resolver",
      "tests": "test-author",
